@startuml
title B05 - Notification routing
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
left to right direction
component "B05\nNotification routing" as B05
interface "schedule_for_incident(); due(); provider_result(); human_acknowledged(); create_door_notice(); build_daily_summary()" as API
database "Owned state\nunique stage jobs, provider state, advisory notices and one-per-day summary keys" as State
queue "Input / output\nIncident/event/window projection → primary/backup jobs, opt-in advisory or summary" as IO
API --> B05
IO --> B05
B05 --> State : owns
component "B04\nIncident workflow" as B04
B05 ..> B04 : contract / port
component "B07\nRead models/API" as B07
B05 ..> B07 : contract / port
component "B08\nOperations/data" as B08
B05 ..> B08 : contract / port
component "A04\nApp incidents" as A04
B05 ..> A04 : contract / port
component "A05\nApp platform" as A05
B05 ..> A05 : contract / port
note bottom of B05
Flow: Schedule primary now and backup at +300 s; select due open jobs; keep provider acceptance separate from human ACK; cancel pending jobs after ACK; summarize coverage honestly.
Guard: No recipient means no invented route; tests never create production notice; a summary cannot resolve an incident; duplicate keys reuse prior intent.
Status: Host complete; target pending
end note
@enduml
